                "text_eegb9C": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Clarity measures how free a diamond is from inclusions (internal) and blemishes (surface). The GIA scale ranges from Flawless to Included, with most diamonds falling in between, where inclusions are microscopic and don't affect beauty.</p><p>The impact of inclusions depends on their size, number, and position. Inclusions near the top facet (table) affect appearance more than those near the girdle (edge). This makes clarity assessment unique for each diamond, emphasizing the importance of individual evaluation rather than relying solely on certification.</p>",
